              <data key="d100">Nitric oxide synthase 3</data>
              <data key="d101">Constitutive NOS; EC-NOS; NOS type III; Nitric oxide synthase, endothelial</data>
              <data key="d104">Produces nitric oxide (NO) which is implicated in vascular smooth muscle relaxation through a cGMP-mediated signal transduction pathway. NO mediates vascular endothelial growth factor (VEGF)-induced angiogenesis in coronary vessels and promotes blood clotting through the activation of platelets</data>
