            <node id="n1::n19::n2">
              <data key="d100">Cytoglobin</data>
              <data key="d101">Histoglobin; Nitric oxygen dioxygenase CYGB; Nitrite reductase CYGB; Pseudoperoxidase CYGB; Stellate cell activation-associated protein; Superoxide dismutase CYGB</data>
              <data key="d104">Probable multifunctional globin with a hexacoordinated heme iron required for the catalysis of various reactions depending on redox condition of the cell as well as oxygen availability. Has a nitric oxide dioxygenase (NOD) activity and is most probably involved in cell-mediated and oxygen-dependent nitric oxide consumption.</data>
