            <node id="n1::n22::n0">
              <data key="d100">Putative hydrolase DDAH2</data>
              <data key="d101">DDAHII; Inactive N(G),N(G)-dimethylarginine dimethylaminohydrolase 2; Protein G6a; S-phase protein</data>
              <data key="d104">Putative hydrolase with unknown substrate (Probable). Does not hydrolyze N(G),N(G)-dimethyl-L-arginine (ADMA) which acts as an inhibitor of NOS.</data>
